      "message": "Mostly for those who want to use our bazel build, this should probably default to false. Even our own builds should be careful about making this `True` since *this breaks platform ABI*. This should generally be treated the same as building for a different target architecture. Thinking about that, it might be more truthful to model this like a `x86_64-pc-linux-gnu_trivial` architecture target or something like that, though that\u0027s rather a pain, I think. Though if it isn\u0027t, I\u0027d be all for that.",
